<v Ira Glass>Our program was produced today by Robyn Semien, with Alex Blumberg, Ben Calhoun, Sarah Koenig, Miki Meek, Jonathan Menjivar, Brian Reed, Alissa Shipp, and Nancy Updike. Our senior producer is Julie Snyder. Production help from Alison Davis.
<v Ira Glass>我们的节目今天由罗宾·塞米恩制作，亚历克斯·布隆伯格、本·卡尔霍恩、莎拉·凯尼格、米基·米克、乔纳森·门吉瓦尔、布莱恩·里德、阿丽莎·希普和南希·厄普代克参与。我们的高级制片人是朱莉·斯奈德。制作协助来自艾莉森·戴维斯。

01:00:24.060 --> 01:00:31.570
<v Ira Glass>Seth Lind is our operations director. Emily Condon's our production manager. Elise Bergerson's our administrative assistant. Adrianne Mathiowetz runs our website.
<v Ira Glass>塞斯·林德是我们的运营总监。艾米丽·康登是我们的制作经理。埃莉斯·伯格森是我们的行政助理。阿德里安娜·马蒂沃维茨负责我们的网站。

01:00:31.570 --> 01:00:40.250
<v Ira Glass>Research help today from Michelle Harris. Music help from Damian Graef and Rob Geddis. Special thanks today to Willow Yamauchi, Craig Desson and the Factory Theater in Toronto.
<v Ira Glass>今天研究协助来自米歇尔·哈里斯。音乐协助来自达米安·格拉夫和罗布·格迪斯。今天特别感谢威洛·ヤマウチ、克雷格·德森和多伦多的工厂剧院。

01:00:40.250 --> 01:00:47.010
<v Ira Glass>Our website, ThisAmericanLife.Org. This American Life is distributed by Public Radio International.
<v Ira Glass>我们的网站，ThisAmericanLife.Org。《美国生活》由国际公共广播电台发行。

01:00:47.010 --> 01:00:56.060
<v Ira Glass>Thanks as always to our show's co-founder Torey Malatia, who remembers meeting Hillary Clinton-- incredible--at some crazy beach party back in the '70s. There she appeared--
<v Ira Glass>一如既往地感谢我们节目的联合创始人托里·马拉蒂亚，他记得70年代在某个疯狂的海滩派对上遇见希拉里·克林顿——难以置信。她出现在那里——

01:00:56.060 --> 01:01:06.020
<v Shane Dubow>A completely naked woman. Blond hair, really muscly. Her shoulders looked like she was probably a rafting guide in Colorado.
<v Shane Dubow>一个完全赤裸的女人。金色的头发，真的很健壮。她的肩膀看起来像是科罗拉多州的漂流向导。

01:01:06.020 --> 01:01:13.530
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Stay warm. Wear a hat. And I'll be back next week with more stories of This American Life .
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。保持温暖。戴上帽子。我下周会回来，带来更多《美国生活》的故事。

